# Auto-deploy after fixes

When you finish implementing code fixes or features the user requested in this repo:

1. Run hosting deploy without waiting for a separate 「배포」 ask:
   - `npm run build`
   - `firebase deploy --only hosting`
2. Report the hosting URL when done (site `dkbooking` → typically `https://dkbooking.web.app`).

## Still require explicit ask

- Do **not** commit, tag, or push unless the user also explicitly asked (e.g. 커밋 / 테그 / 태그 / push).
- Deploy preference ≠ permission to commit/tag/push.

## Scope & safety

- Deploy only the project you edited (`diving-reservation`). Do not deploy unrelated repos.
- Never force-push or skip git hooks (`--no-verify`, etc.).
- If build or deploy fails, fix or report the error; do not pretend it succeeded.
